# S-42 — Close campaigns, pool sweep, goal corrections (#71 sweep, #136, #137; job CloseCampaigns). Result 30 Sep 2026: as expected.
# #71 digital-teacher offer close {sweepPool: true} → isActive false, swept "20.00", pairId; goal_adjustment pool_sweep_out −20.00
#   (digital-teacher) + pool_sweep_in +20.00 (education-fund, the general fund) with the same pair_id; raised 1070 → 1050 and 0 → 20;
#   pool 0.00; the contribution with 20.00 left → remaining 0, swept_to_fund_at set; PoolSwept queued · close again → swept null
# CloseCampaigns: smart-study (pool 60.00) and family-remote (pool 55.00 = 30.00 zakat + 25.00 sadaqa; zakat allowed in the dev DB
#   only) set past ends_at → run 1: both inactive, 60.00 and 25.00 swept (job:CloseCampaigns); the 30.00 zakat stays in the pool
#   (never swept, RUL-46) · run 2: no new adjustment or PoolSwept (sweeps once)
# #137 correction +150.00 on education-fund → 201 {adjustment, goal (raisedAmount 255.00, totals with seed)} · −99999.00 → 422
#   goal.adjustment_invalid (counter would go negative) · 0/0 → 422 · "1.234" and no note → 400 · #136 list (sweeps + correction)
# roles: store_manager 403 · finance list 200, post 201 · integrity checks (4 pool = Σ remaining, 6 goals incl. adjustments) → 0 rows
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1/admin

### #71 Close an offer and sweep its pool
POST {{base}}/offers/{{offerId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sweepPool":true}

### #136 Goal adjustments
GET {{base}}/products/{{productId}}/goal-adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{finance}}

### #137 Correction
POST {{base}}/products/{{productId}}/goal-adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{finance}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":"150.00","units":0,"note":"تبرع نقدي مسجّل يدويًا"}

### Job (dev)
POST http://localhost:5080/dev/jobs/CloseCampaignsJob/run
